      "text": [
        " قُلْتُ لِأَبِي عَبْدِ اللَّهِ ( عليه السلام ) كَمِ التَّعْزِيرُ فَقَالَ دُونَ الْحَدِّ قَالَ قُلْتُ دُونَ ثَمَانِينَ قَالَ فَقَالَ لَا وَ لَكِنْ دُونَ الْأَرْبَعِينَ فَإِنَّهُ حَدُّ الْمَمْلُوكِ قَالَ قُلْتُ وَ كَمْ ذَلِكَ قَالَ قَالَ عَلَى قَدْرِ مَا يَرَى الْوَالِي مِنْ ذَنْبِ الرَّجُلِ وَ قُوَّةِ بَدَنِهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Al Husayn Bin Muhammad, from Moala Bin Muhammad, from Al hassan Bin Ali, from Hammad Bin Usman who said, ",
          "‘I said to Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, ‘How much is the reprimand?’ So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Less than the Penalty (<span class=\"iTxt\">Hadd</span>)’. I said, ‘Less than eighty (lashes)?’ So he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘No, but it is less than the forty (lashes), for it is a Penalty (<span class=\"iTxt\">Hadd</span>) of the owned (slaves)’. I said, ‘And how much is that?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Upon the measurement of what the guardian sees fit from a sin of the man, and strength of his body’."
        ]
      }
    },
